<h2 id="dependencies">First-Level Dependencies &amp; Upstream Tools</h2>
<p>
  RunZero builds upon best-of-breed open-source virtualization and runtime
  platforms:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <a href="https://orbstack.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>OrbStack</strong></a
    >: Superfast, lightweight container engine and Linux Virtual Machine
    hypervisor for macOS.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://www.docker.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>Docker Engine &amp; Compose</strong></a
    >: Industry standard container runtime and service orchestration.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a
      href="https://www.unix-ag.uni-kl.de/~bloch/acng/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"><strong>apt-cacher-ng</strong></a
    >: High-performance caching proxy for Debian and Ubuntu APT package
    downloads.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://verdaccio.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>Verdaccio</strong></a
    >: Lightweight zero-config private npm proxy registry with web interface.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://github.com/gomods/athens" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>Athens</strong></a
    >: Enterprise-grade Go module caching proxy server.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>NVM (Node Version Manager)</strong></a
    >: Multi-version Node.js environment pre-baking Node 20, 22, and 24.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>Microsoft .NET SDK</strong></a
    >: Cross-platform .NET 8.0 SDK runtime for C# and F# builds.
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="https://playwright.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
      ><strong>Playwright</strong></a
    >: Reliable end-to-end testing for modern web apps with pre-installed OS
    dependencies.
  </li>
</ul>
